# wandr monorepo .gitignore.
#
# Post task-52/53 reorg: the previous flat .gitignore of sibling repo
# names (`wandr-*/`, `compose-*/`, `skiko/`, `markdown-renderer/`, ...)
# is obsolete — those siblings are now either subtree-merged into
# apps/, runtime/, repros/ (tracked here) or registered as submodules
# under external/ (tracked at the parent level by gitlink).
#
# Each submodule has its own .gitignore inside its own working tree.
# This .gitignore is for the parent monorepo only.

# Build artifacts
**/build/
**/target/
**/.gradle/

# Rust
**/Cargo.lock.bak


# .NET (dotnet/ guest libs + apps/user/*.avalonia.* etc.)
**/bin/
**/obj/
repros/avalonia-spike*/**/native/*.a
**/generated/wit/

# OpenSwiftUIProject test-harness build output + logs (the 6 library repos are submodules)
swift/OpenSwiftUIProject/**/.build/
swift/OpenSwiftUIProject/tests/logs/

# cross-AOT deploy staging (regenerable: stripped wasm + aarch64 cwasm)
swift/OpenSwiftUIProject/tests/deploy/
